# Study run outputs (run_study.py --out study*). Ignore the generated bulk wherever
# the run directory lands, but always keep the machine-readable metrics.
# Leading **/ is required: a pattern containing a slash is otherwise anchored to the
# repo root and would never match nested run directories.
# Re-including the directories is required: git does not descend into an excluded
# directory, so a negation targeting files inside it would have no effect.
**/study*/**
!**/study*/**/
!**/study*/**/*.json

# Keep our comparison plots; original paper pages and embedded full report stay local.
!simulation_reproduction/comparison/*.png
simulation_reproduction/comparison/P*-p*.png
simulation_reproduction/comparison/论文与仿真逐项对比分析.html
simulation_reproduction/comparison/source_manifest.json
simulation_reproduction/comparison/analysis_manifest.json
simulation_reproduction/comparison/verification.json
